  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Standards, tools, and training to increase systemic impact through investment (University of Cape Town)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims to improve the capacity of different actors within the investment ecosystem to adopt an approach which maximises sustainable impact beyond the investee firms, and then provide them with tools and benchmarking standards to assess their success in doing so.</narrative>
  </description>
